            f"{'🔒 STRICT isolation ON' if strict else '🔓 Strict isolation OFF (passwords can be synced)'}\n\n"
            "Each profile has its own:\n"
            "  • Passwords & saved login data\n"
            "  • Cookies & storage\n"
            "  • Bookmarks\n"
            "  • History\n"
            "  • Extensions\n"
